      "translatedText": "The current False continues to use the motion estimation provided upstream by Point-LIO and still generates a 2D grid; the source code merely skips this node's 2D matching, graph nodes, and association construction\\. This cannot be used to claim that the vehicle SLAM has been disabled, nor can it be used to prove that the long\\-distance 2D graph will not drift\\.[Normal processing path (2\\.6\\.10)](https://github.com/SteveMacenski/slam_toolbox/blob/2.6.10/lib/karto_sdk/src/Mapper.cpp)",
